<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings after the latest</p>
<p>round of four-day Supersport Series cricket matches which ended</p>
<p>on Tuesday (tabulated under played, won, lost, drawn, batting</p>
<p>points, bowling points, total points):</p>
<p> Western Province   7   4  1   2   25  24   89</p>
<p> Natal		  6   4  1   1   23  24   87</p>
<p> Border		 7   3  1   3   21  21   72</p>
<p> Transvaal	    6   3  2   1   20  21   71</p>
<p> Eastern Province   6   3  2   1   21  16   67</p>
<p> Free State	   6   2  0   4   18  17   55</p>
<p> Boland		 7   2  4   1   11  22   53</p>
<p> Griqualand West    7   1  5   1   16  14   40</p>
<p> Northern Transvaal 6   0  6   0   12  18   30</p>
</text>
